Commit:     Magnus Melin <mkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi>
CommitDate: Wed Feb 18 07:53:12 2026 +0200

    Bug 1935334 - Remove usage of PluralForm.sys.mjs from calendar. r=babolivier,dandarnell

    I'm dropping the noun form conversions for plulral weekdays.
    Only three locales ever set `pluralForWeekdays = true`, and from what I can tell, at least two of those incorrectly/unnecessarily so.
    EIther way, it was a hack, but a proper fix would be to have permutations for all forms of every weekday, for every combination, which is huge and complex.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D279310

